@startuml 01-character-creation
!pragma layout smetana
title Creazione personaggi - Factory Method e Builder

left to right direction
skinparam classAttributeIconSize 0
hide empty members
hide circle

class "characters.yaml\nenemies.yaml" as CharacterYaml <<asset>>
abstract class PlayerFactory <<Creator>>
class YamlPlayerFactory <<Concrete Creator>>
abstract class EnemyFactory <<Creator>>
class YamlEnemyFactory <<Concrete Creator>>
interface CharacterBuilder <<Builder>>
class CharacterBuildDirector <<Director>>
class PlayerBuilder <<Concrete Builder>>
class EnemyBuilder <<Concrete Builder>>
abstract class Character
class Player
class Enemy <<Prototype>>

PlayerFactory <|-- YamlPlayerFactory
EnemyFactory <|-- YamlEnemyFactory
CharacterYaml --> YamlPlayerFactory
CharacterYaml --> YamlEnemyFactory
YamlPlayerFactory --> PlayerBuilder
YamlEnemyFactory --> EnemyBuilder
YamlPlayerFactory --> CharacterBuildDirector
YamlEnemyFactory --> CharacterBuildDirector
CharacterBuildDirector --> CharacterBuilder : ordina i passi
CharacterBuilder <|.. PlayerBuilder
CharacterBuilder <|.. EnemyBuilder
PlayerBuilder --> Player : build
EnemyBuilder --> Enemy : build
Character <|-- Player
Character <|-- Enemy

note bottom of CharacterBuilder
Factory Method seleziona la sorgente YAML.
Il Director ordina i passi dichiarati dal Builder.
Player ed Enemy sono gli unici prodotti concreti.
end note
@enduml
